  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&apos;s contribution to OHCHR Peace Missions Support Section (PMSS) 2023-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of Denmark&apos;s contribution to OHCHR Peace Missions Support Section (PMSS) is to prevent violations and strengthen protection of human rights, including in situations of conflict and insecurity. The contribution is part of Denmark&apos;s core voluntary support to OHCHR.</narrative>
